<title>USA: JDN Realty to offer 2.4 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>JDN Realty to offer 2.4 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>JDN Realty Corp said Thursday it planned a public offering of 2.4 million shares at $29 each.  </p>
<p>JDN said it planned to use net proceeds to repay financing that funded its &quot;development, redevelopment and acquisition activities.&quot;</p>
<p>The stock offering is underwritten by Merrill Lynch &amp; Co and A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons Inc, it said.</p>
<p>JDN is a real estate company specializing in the development and asset management of retail shopping centers.</p>
</text>
